    "profile_text": {
        "body": "WeRide Inc. describes itself as a commercial-stage global company that develops autonomous driving technologies from Level 2 to Level 4. Its website says the company operates in more than 60 cities across 13 countries and offers a portfolio of five core products, including Robotaxi. The company points to its WeRide One universal autonomous driving technology platform, a self-developed foundational toolchain, and what it calls an industry-leading accumulation of real-world operational data.\n\nThe company says it is listed on Nasdaq under WRD and on the Hong Kong Stock Exchange under 0800, and that it has been recognized in Fortune's 2025 Change the World and 2025 Future 50 lists. SEC records list WeRide Inc. under CIK 0001867729 as a public company, with the alias WERIDE INC-ADR also appearing in those records.",
